      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1488,
      "heading": "See every dependency, every event.",
      "backgroundColor": "#14110D",
      "callsToAction": [
        "1 Stars",
        "Get Started →"
      ],
      "text": "1 Stars See every dependency, every event. Audit-log plugin for samber/do v2. Track every registration, invocation, and shutdown with timestamps, dependency graphs, and self-contained HTML visualization. Get Started → $ go get github.com/LarsArtmann/samber-do-auditlog main.go package main import ( \"os\" auditlog \"github.com/LarsArtmann/samber-do-auditlog\" \"github.com/samber/do/v2\" ) func main() { plugin, err := auditlog.New(auditlog.Config{ Enabled: true, ContainerID: \"my-app\", }) if err != nil { panic(err) } injector := do.NewWithOpts(plugin.Opts()) // Register and invoke services as usual do.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
