      "text": "Built for real debugging. Drop it into any Go service using samber/do. Debugging Spot circular dependencies and slow builds instantly Observability Stream events to Prometheus, OTel, or live dashboards CI / CD Export reports as build artifacts for audit trails Performance Profile first-build durations and invocation counts",
      "layout": "centered",
